\par\par \b \uc2  BOJ  \highlight22\uc2 Intervenes \highlight\uc2  In New York As Well As Tokyo, London-Kyodo \b0\par\par\uc2 199 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 Mai 2002\par 19:51\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2002, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  NEW YORK -(Dow Jones)- -The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets in New York as well as Tokyo and "apparently" London, Kyodo news agency reported Friday. \par \par \uc2  In a dispatch from Tokyo, the agency said the Bank of Japan was apparently worried that a creeping rise of the yen would hamper Japanese exports and sold yen for the dollar Friday in a bid to arrest a steady rise in the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  According to the report, financial sources said the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  stepped into the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market first in Tokyo and later in New York, and apparently also in London. \par \par \uc2  The effect of the market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Tokyo was short-lived, as the pressure on the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  remained unabated, Kyodo said. \par \par \uc2  "We have taken appropriate action today in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market as a follow-up to last week's \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Finance Minister Masajuro Shiokawa said after the Bank of Japan conducted the dollar-buying \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the agency reported. \par \par \uc2  "Recent movements in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates have been too rapid," he said, according to the report. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  conducted yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  twice last week. \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020020531dy5v00139\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
