\par\par \b \uc2  Dollar/yen at lows as US stocks deepen losses. \b0\par\par\uc2 273 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Mai 2002\par 21:03\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  1901 GMT - Dollar/yen stuck near session lows beneath 124.50 yen , down 0.23 percent from prior U.S. close with battered stocks dampening appetite to buy dollars. Analysts say a prolonged visit below 200-day moving average at 125.74 could open the door to much deeper declines beneath 120 yen. \par \par \uc2  - Worries about further Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 /\b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  keeping a lid on yen appreciation, but dealers uncertain how much longer yen bulls can be kept at bay. \par \par \uc2  - Euro/dollar mired beneath earlier highs above 93 cents. Dealers say a close above 92.80 area would open a test of 93.13, with next stop being the March 2001 high at 93.33 cents. Euro/yen up 0.65 percent on day, trades around 115.60 yen . \par \par \uc2  - Earlier, the Conference Board said its closely watched index of consumer confidence rose to 109.8 in May, from downwardly revised 108.5 in April. mostly in line with expectations. But the six-month expectations fell for a second straight month, to 109.4 from 109.6 in prior month. \par \par \uc2  - Dollar/Swiss trades 0.60 percent lower, hovers around 1.5730 francs . Euro hits one-month high versus Swiss franc near 1.4620 . \par \par \uc2  - In offshore trading, Japanese Finance Minister Masajuro Shiokawa said he would monitor flucturations in the \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. Added that the movement from yen weakness to strength has been "too drastic," and he doubted current market conditions would stabilize. \par \par \uc2  - Dow Jones Industrial Average accelerates declines, off 1.3 percent , with Nasdaq down 1.1 percent . \par \par \uc2  For full report on major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020528dy5s010fg\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
